1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Your tread just got fingerprinted.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Four patterns. Four suspects.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Flat across the center?
Suspect: overinflation.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Worn on both edges?
Suspect: underinflation.

5
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Worn on just one edge?
Suspect: alignment — not air.

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Cupped, scalloped patches?
Suspect: worn suspension.

7
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:30,000
One clue never closes the case.
Worth checking — not worth guessing.
